%N A123459 Number of strict opposition perfect graphs on n nodes.
%C A123459 Graphs which admit an acyclic orientation of its edges such that in every induced path on 4 vertices the two end edges either both point inwards or both point outwards. All such graphs are perfect (Hougardy, 2006). - _Meghanto Majumder_, Sep 29 2026
